OL,3,ABlack Doves actress says she loved
OL,4,Aplaying 'a very Welsh assassin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAward-winning actress Gabrielle Creevy
OL,7,Fhas told how she loved being able to
OL,8,Fplay "a very Welsh assassin" in the
OL,9,Fupcoming new season of spy thriller
OL,10,FBlack Doves.
OL,12,FCreevy plays the role of Eleanor in the
OL,13,FNetflix drama, starring alongside
OL,14,Factors including Keira Knightley, Sarah
OL,15,FLancashire and Ben Whishaw.
OL,17,FThe Port Talbot-born actress told Lucy
OL,18,FOwen on BBC Radio Wales she had
OL,19,Fauditioned with a Welsh accent "and
OL,20,Fthey kind of loved it", with the show
OL,21,Fwriting in extra details to add to her
OL,22,Fcharacter.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
