OL,3,ABlack Doves actress says she loved
OL,4,Aplaying 'a very Welsh assassin'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm kind of thrilled that they went
OL,7,Fwith it because as a kid growing up and
OL,8,Fwatching things, there was never that,
OL,9,Fthere was never the Welsh accent," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
